WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.850
Roget ran away with Yuzu!

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:03.950
What?

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:06.670
I am not running...

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:11.160
I am temporarily withdrawing to recoup 
my strength. It's strategy!

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:14.860
Reiji Akaba...

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:21.750
Wait for me, Yuzu...

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.620
I'm coming to save you now!

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:26.570
D-Wheels.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:30.750
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.480
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:35.900
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:38.020
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:16.980
The Eternal Duel

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:22.620
Hey, wait!

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:25.360
How can you run so fast in those iron sandals?

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:29.020
When my comrades are in danger, 
I must move quickly!

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:32.870
Kurosaki...

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:35.730
Damn! Let me on one of those!

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:47.950
Let's go!

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:49.250
Right!

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:55.850
Go, Rise Falcon!

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:11.290
Combining a monster that can't 
be targeted by effects with

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:13.870
an Equip Spell that prevents 
destruction by battle...

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:19.070
And an effect that deals you 
1000 damage every turn...

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:21.960
It is a true unbreakable combo!

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:25.420
There is no one who can defeat it.

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:31.800
As there are no absolutes in business, 
there are no absolutes in duels, either.

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:34.090
No matter how hard you hedge your risk,

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:37.160
cracks will always appear somewhere.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:39.130
Cracks?

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:42.880
To quickly locate and deal with them is the duty

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:45.200
of those who stand at the top.

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.840
My turn!

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:52.340
I activate my Continuous Spell Forbidden 
Dark Contract with the Swamp King!

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:59.200
Its effect lets me Special Summon 
D/D/D Chaos King Apocalypse,

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:02.440
with monster effect negated, from my hand.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:06.220
A Pendulum Monster?

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:09.290
When a Chaos King Apocalypse,

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:12.750
Special Summoned via Forbidden 
Dark Contract, is used as a component,

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:15.770
I can Fusion Summon without Polymerization.

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:21.240
I fuse Chaos King Apocalypse 
and D/D Lamia in my hand.

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:25.520
King, who predicts the patterns 
of chaos in the world...

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:29.320
Drain the blood, swept toward the future, 
and become the dragon-slaying hero!

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:31.680
Fusion Summon!

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:37.720
Be born, Level 8 D/D/D Dragonbane King Beowulf!

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:43.530
Fusion Summon without a Polymerization spell?

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:45.900
As expected of the Professor's son.

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:49.900
When D/D Lamia is sent to the graveyard 
as a fusion component,

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:55.840
I can Special Summon it, once per turn, by sending 
a Dark Contract card to the graveyard.

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:59.910
I send my currently activated Forbidden Dark 
Contract with the Swamp King to the graveyard,

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:03.750
to Special Summon Tuner Monster D/D Lamia!

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:08.540
A Tuner?

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:10.360
You can Synchro Summon, too?

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:11.850
Of course...

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:12.560
What?

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:16.760
I control all methods of summoning.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:18.760
Yuzu!

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:21.470
Yuzu!

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:25.800
I set the Pendulum Scale

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:31.060
with Scale 6 D/D Savant Thomas 
and Scale 8 D/D Nikola!

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:39.830
Now I can summon Level 7 monsters.

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:44.040
The great power that shakes my soul,

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:45.570
reside in my body

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:48.590
and become the new light that 
cuts through the darkness!

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.590
Pendulum Summon!

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:52.940
Be reborn from my Extra Deck!

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:59.300
D/D/D Chaos King Apocalypse!

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:05.460
And Level 1 D/D Lamia tunes Level 7 
D/D/D Chaos King Apocalypse!

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:12.120
Raise your blood-stained sword, 
and transcend the corpses of heroes!

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:15.190
Synchro Summon.

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:21.660
Be born, Level 8 Cursed King Siegfried!

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:24.630
You can also go from Pendulum to Synchro...

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:28.030
Until the next Standby Phase,

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:34.990
D/D/D Siegfried lets me negate the effect 
of one activated spell card on the field.

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:39.000
I negate the Equip Spell Ancient 
Gear Magic Shield,

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:42.150
equipped to Ancient Gear Howitzer!

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:48.950
Gear Howitzer's defense points...

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:50.430
Battle.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:51.920
Go, Beowulf.

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:55.310
Attack Ancient Gear Howitzer!

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:58.980
Beowulf's attacks deal piercing damage.

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:07.960
And Siegfried attacks you directly!

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:09.740
This will end it!

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:24.600
That did not end it.

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:28.150
This duel will never end.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:31.990
Roget is invincible?

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:33.920
Indeed.

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:37.440
When he dueled Master Sora and me...

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:40.640
Go! Frightfur Bear!

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.510
Attack Roget directly!

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:48.980
He disappeared?

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:50.390
Where is Lady Yuzu?

00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:58.680
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:09.830
Entering the battle? So it's a different Roget?

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:11.040
Indeed.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:16.010
But I am I. There is no change in the 
fact that I am Jean-Michel Roget.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:18.310
That is why I do not lose.

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:23.320
No matter how many times I am beaten, 
I shall return, like the undying phoenix.

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:26.280
Until you cry out, suffering and exhausted,

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:31.820
that you cannot fight any more!

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:37.430
What is this?

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:39.400
It's ruined...

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:43.120
I was sure this was the room 
Sora contacted us from.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:46.360
You think he was blown up with it?

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:49.070
It would take more than this to kill him.

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:50.510
Kurosaki?

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:51.770
When did you...

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:55.280
He won't die until he's completed his objective.

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:59.480
Such is the determination of Sora Shiunin.

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:05.160
I can do nothing with this lock.

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:07.130
Layra! Tsukikage!

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:08.130
Yuya!

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:09.590
Where's Yuzu?

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:12.560
My brother is fighting to get her back.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:15.530
He's in this room, with Roget.

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:23.800
I activate the Pendulum Effect 
of D/D Savant Thomas.

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:28.580
Once per turn, I can return one Pendulum 
Monster from my Extra Deck to my hand.

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:33.610
I return D/D/D Chaos King Apocalypse.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:36.380
I set one card and end my turn!

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:42.190
That's right... This duel will 
continue until you concede.

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:46.060
Now! Let us enjoy it, Reiji Akaba.

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:52.600
Damn! The enemy's right there, but...

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:54.090
Yuya!

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:55.070
Gongenzaka!

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:58.860
Yuzu's in that room.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:02.780
Inside, Reiji's now fighting Roget to save her!

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:04.650
But the door's locked.

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:08.120
I'll undo the lock...

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:09.990
Sora!

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:12.560
Sorry.

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:16.380
Not only did I lose Serena... But Yuzu, too.

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:17.180
Sora!

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:18.700
Don't force yourself.

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:22.700
Thanks. But leave it to me.

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:26.670
I promise I'll get us past that lock.

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:27.900
Sora...

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:41.490
Yuzu!

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:42.870
Brother!

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:48.190
An eternal duel, eh?

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:49.920
Interesting.

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.160
Eternal?

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:54.300
Yes! I shall never lose!

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:56.340
If it is to go on eternally...

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:01.840
You'll be giving up before I will.

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:04.600
You think I shall concede first?!

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:07.810
Don't be ridiculous.

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:10.360
My turn!

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:15.390
In that instant, I Special Summon Chaos King 
Apocalypse from my hand, using its effect.

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:23.490
Then, I destroy D/D Savant Thomas

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:25.730
and D/D Savant Nikola in my Pendulum Zones!

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:27.930
What?

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:32.640
During your turn, this effect 
can be activated only once.

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:36.840
Isn't Pendulum the weapon of the Lancers?

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:39.210
To abandon it yourself...

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:41.110
Have you realized you will lose?!

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:43.400
I haven't abandoned it.

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:48.240
When D/D Savant Nikola is destroyed 
and sent to my Extra Deck,

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:51.660
one Pendulum Monster on the 
field is returned to my hand.

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:58.220
And Nikola and Thomas, in my Extra Deck, 
are set once more in my Pendulum Zones!

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:08.680
Then, I activate my Continuous Trap Dark 
Contract with the Swinging Abyss!

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:12.750
When one D/D Pendulum Monster 
is returned to my hand,

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:16.050
I deal its defense points as damage to you.

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:19.300
Chaos King Apocalypse's 
defense points are 2000.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:22.750
Thus, you take 2000 points of damage!

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:31.690
He disappeared!

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:32.830
But another...

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:36.530
It's useless... Useless, useless.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:38.740
He's back again?

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:43.110
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:46.350
No matter how many times 
I am defeated, I shall return.

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:49.950
Yes, and the same thing will happen.

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.070
Over and over.

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:52.220
What?

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:54.620
Chaos King Apocalypse, in my hand,

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:59.100
can destroy Thomas and Nikola, in the Pendulum 
Zones, to be Special Summoned.

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:05.880
But through Nikola's effect, Chaos King 
Apocalypse can be returned to my hand,

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:08.830
and the two Pendulum Cards 
are set once more.

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:14.230
Then the effect of Continuous Trap Dark 
Contract with the Swinging Abyss

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:17.110
will deal 2000 damage to you.

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:21.810
Since you have already taken the 
2000-point penalty to join the duel,

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:23.150
that will extinguish your life!

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:27.800
Every time you rejoin, you'll lose.

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:29.750
Eternally.

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:35.690
Now, tell me your plan!

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:40.440
Yuzu!

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:43.300
You still intend to continue, Roget?!

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:49.510
Are you so desperate to ruin me, Reiji Akaba?

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:54.880
While using your front, known as the 
Lancers, to play at righteousness?

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:56.710
What is he saying?

00:13:57.090 --> 00:14:01.420
His father, Leo Akaba, is the Professor.

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:05.160
He is your real enemy... Academia's leader!

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:06.600
Leo Akaba?

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:10.360
Founder of LDS, head of the Leo Corporation?

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:12.330
That Leo Akaba?

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.830
Reiji Akaba's father is the Professor?

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.190
That's right.

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:18.110
You have been deceived.

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:21.420
You have been made accomplices 
in the interdimensional war!

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:22.470
Deceived?

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:26.880
The Akaba father and son started a 
war between the four dimensions,

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.810
plotting to take control of them.

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:32.890
Father used the Fusion Dimension as a 
bridge to attack the Xyz Dimension.

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:37.290
Son used the Standard Dimension as a 
bridge to attack the Synchro Dimension.

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:41.260
You Lancers are but his advance battalion!

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:45.690
And since I am in his way, 
he wants to eliminate me.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.910
A well-executed plot.

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:52.080
So in my place, starting today, you are City's...

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:54.970
the Synchro Dimension's new king!

00:14:57.590 --> 00:15:00.910
If I were working with Leo Akaba,

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:07.020
why would you try to take Yuzu Hiiragi 
to the Fusion Dimension?

00:15:07.830 --> 00:15:11.390
It's because you're trying to retreat 
into Leo Akaba's arms, isn't it?

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:15.590
In other words, what you're saying is a lie!

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:20.000
I believe in Reiji Akaba!

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:23.380
He isn't like you, thinking only of himself!

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:25.970
Give Yuzu back!

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:27.790
No!

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:29.550
I shall survive!

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:31.940
Yuzu Hiiragi is my lifeline to achieving that.

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:33.680
I shall not hand her over.

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:38.650
Come on!

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:41.350
Yuzu!

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.380
That's right.

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:49.680
I should have simply taken Yuzu 
Hiiragi back like this,

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:53.260
without engaging Reiji Akaba.

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:57.970
By herself, she will be enough to 
make the Professor very happy.

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:00.360
I can live a little longer!

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:01.920
Will you, really?

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:06.840
We won't let you get away!

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:10.830
You bear the responsibility for 
plunging City into chaos!

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:14.120
Go, Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:16.950
Absolute Power Flame!

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:26.930
No!

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:30.870
Yuzu!

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:35.570
Hippo!

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:45.080
Yuzu!

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:47.050
Yuzu... Yuzu!

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:50.020
You're okay now, Yuzu!

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:55.130
Yuya...

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:56.460
Yuzu!

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:00.570
Yuzu... I finally found you.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:03.420
We finally... finally...

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:05.400
Yuzu!

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:25.320
Damn you...

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:26.260
Roget!

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:31.230
You think I will let it end this way?

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.960
He survived?

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:38.160
The reason I built this dimensional transport

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:40.670
wasn't merely to return to the Fusion Dimension!

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:43.640
When I learned of Academia's invasion,

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:46.890
I made it so it could move City 
itself through dimensions!

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:47.820
What?

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:49.110
City itself?

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:53.080
But there is no need to run now.

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:56.120
I am dead, either way.

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:58.060
So I shall take you...

00:17:58.440 --> 00:18:02.530
no, the whole city with me.

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:08.000
I shall plunge everything into the 
gap between dimensions!

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.010
Fall! Fall!

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:20.760
Fall, all of you!

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:24.420
Master Layra!

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:26.050
Layra!

00:18:28.150 --> 00:18:29.020
Brother!

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:32.260
Roget!

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:35.260
What?

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:43.900
What is that?

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:45.680
It's such a bright light.

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:46.870
It's enveloping...

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:48.890
The Public Order Bureau...

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:55.300
It's disappearing.

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:57.950
The symbol of Tops' control...

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:00.420
Security's headquarters...

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:05.390
Yes! Disappear, disappear!

00:19:05.390 --> 00:19:08.230
If things won't go the way I want,

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:12.700
this world... all of you... can disappear!

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:16.200
Disappear, all of you!

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:33.280
Is everyone okay?

00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:35.990
Yeah, more or less.

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:38.230
Roget disappeared?

00:19:38.800 --> 00:19:40.170
Where did he go?

00:19:49.300 --> 00:19:51.850
Yuya, where's Roget?

00:19:51.850 --> 00:19:53.180
I don't know.

00:19:53.180 --> 00:19:55.010
He was sucked into some kind of hole.

00:19:57.190 --> 00:19:58.140
But...

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:00.680
You're right here.

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:05.160
No one's taking you. You're here.

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:07.150
Yuya...

00:20:13.970 --> 00:20:16.330
Let's go together, Yuzu.

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:25.120
What is this?

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.180
What? What's going on?

00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:31.080
I don't know. But if the dimensional 
transport is still...

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:32.980
Yuzu!

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:35.450
Yuya!

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:37.220
Yuzu!

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:41.770
Gongenzaka...

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:01.690
What just happened?

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:04.540
It appeared to be

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:10.040
a wormhole, created when Roget overloaded 
the dimensional-transport device.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.520
A wormhole?

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:16.430
A sort of tunnel between dimensions.

00:21:16.430 --> 00:21:20.920
Yes, but the route wasn't properly calculated.

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:23.040
Then, where are they?

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:25.740
Most likely, in another dimension.

00:21:25.740 --> 00:21:29.670
But there is no way to know

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:31.620
exactly where.

00:21:53.400 --> 00:21:54.650
Hey, what is this?

00:21:54.650 --> 00:21:56.240
Did City get blown to pieces?

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:57.000
No.

00:21:58.290 --> 00:21:59.960
This is Heartland City...

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:02.910
The Xyz Dimension.

00:22:02.910 --> 00:22:06.140
In other words, my home.

00:23:49.870 --> 00:23:52.670
This is Heartland City. The Xyz Dimension.

00:23:52.670 --> 00:23:54.800
In other words, my home.

00:23:54.800 --> 00:23:57.710
This is awful. Everything is destroyed.

00:23:57.710 --> 00:23:59.960
And there's not a single person here!

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.850
Kurosaki, shouldn't your allies in 
the Resistance still be here?

00:24:03.850 --> 00:24:08.030
For Academia's invasion to have progressed 
so far during my time away...

00:24:08.030 --> 00:24:10.830
Could the Resistance have been destroyed?

00:24:11.120 --> 00:24:15.820
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Capital of Despair, Heartland City.

00:24:15.820 --> 00:24:17.820
The fun is only getting started!
